From 19f5a4fc0ae701753518a2fc944a99addb515654 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BellSoft <info@bell-sw.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:33:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Runtime types from the module's Products table

osv-internal 0.5.5 replaces its EcosystemJDK/EcosystemNIK constants by the
Products table: a vendor may build the module with several JDK and NIK
families. syft gives every family its own package type (pkg.VendorRuntimeType,
the family's purl name); grype reads the family of a runtime package from that
type (vendordb.ProductOfType) and matches it with the version grammar of the
family's kind, and the vendor options list the module's families.
---
 cmd/grype/cli/options/vendor.go               | 21 +++--
 cmd/grype/cli/options/vendor_test.go          | 14 +--
 grype/matcher/vendorjdk/matcher.go            |  6 +-
 .../matcher/vendorjdk/matcher_module_test.go  |  7 +-
 grype/matcher/vendorjdk/matcher_test.go       | 35 +++++---
 grype/pkg/package.go                          |  2 +-
